sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant R1 as Staff request A
  participant R2 as Staff request B
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  R1->>DB: staff_queue_entry_action(entry, serving)
  rect rgb(232, 244, 255)
    Note over R1,DB: Transaction A
    DB->>DB: SELECT entry FOR UPDATE
    DB->>DB: Recheck status = waiting
    R2->>DB: staff_queue_entry_action(entry, serving)
    Note over R2,DB: Transaction B waits on same row lock
    DB->>DB: UPDATE status/timestamps
    DB->>DB: INSERT event; trigger INSERTs SMS outbox
    DB-->>R1: Commit success
  end
  rect rgb(255, 242, 232)
    Note over R2,DB: Transaction B resumes with current row
    DB->>DB: Recheck now sees status = serving
    DB-->>R2: Raise invalid transition; rollback
  end
